                <pb facs="0310" n="222" sameAs="frus:frus1933v05/pg222"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2131/45: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dawson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-08-19T20:00:00-05:00">August 19, 1933—8
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 9:15 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>74. Legation’s 73, August 14, 5 p.m. Francisco Restrepo Plata and Arturo
                    Hernandez, members of the Supreme Customs Tribunal, are being appointed advisers
                    in lieu of Guzmán and will leave shortly. Publicity not yet given here.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
